"flow":"vikingfile","label":"USA 4.xx Base - Vikingfile","platform":"ps5","record":"pegasus-dlps-PPSA35022-0"}],"PPSA35023":[{"id":"r362bd40027fc","format":"binary","filename":"PPSA35023-game-unknown-r362bd40027fc.binary","url":"https://akirabox.to/1RgzRLREXmbp/file","browserUrl":"https://akirabox.to/1RgzRLREXmbp/file","requiresBrowser":true,"sizeBytes":null,"version":"","category":"game","provider":"AkiraBox","source":"pegasus-dlps","flow":"akirabox","label":"USA 4.xx Base - Akirabox","platform":"ps5","record":"pegasus-dlps-PPSA35023-0"},{"id":"r550cd4523b05","format":"binary","filename":"PPSA35023-game-unknown-r550cd4523b05.binary","url":"https://vikingfile.com/f/GniGJuFBNM","browserUrl":"https://vikingfile.com/f/GniGJuFBNM","requiresBrowser":true,"sizeBytes":null,"version":"","category":"game","provider":"VikingFile","source":"pegasus-dlps","flow":"vikingfile","label":"USA 4.xx Base - Vikingfile","platform":"ps5","record":"pegasus-dlps-PPSA35023-0"},{"id":"r2417cc36c5db","format":"binary","filename":"PPSA35023-game-unknown-r2417cc36c5db.binary","url":"https://akirabox.to/0Kezk0wlpGD1/file","browserUrl":"https://akirabox.to/0Kezk0wlpGD1/file","requiresBrowser":true,"sizeBytes":null,"version":"","category":"game","provider":"AkiraBox","source":"pegasus-dlps","flow":"akirabox","label":"USA 4.xx Base - Akirabox","platform":"ps5","record":"pegasus-dlps-PPSA35023-0"},{"id":"r885d6636e73e","format":"binary","filename":"PPSA35023-game-unknown-r885d6636e73e.binary","url":"https://vikingfile.com/f/aesAJ0r5T1","browserUrl":"https://vikingfile.com/f/aesAJ0r5T1","requiresBrowser":true,"sizeBytes":null,"version":"","category":"game","provider":"VikingFile","source":"pegasus-dlps","flow":"vikingfile","label":"USA 4.xx Base - Vikingfile","platform":"ps5","record":"pegasus-dlps-PPSA35023-0"}]},"pages":{"PPSA04259":{"about":["Dungeons of Sundaria is an action-packed RPG where Heroes adventure through epic dungeons facing fearsome creatures either solo or with a group of friends. Master your class, loot everything, and destroy the foul creatures of the deep!","The Dungeons:","• 8 Unique Dungeons filled with hundreds of fiendish monsters and diabolical bosses.","• Three Levels of Difficulty.","• Single player up to 4-player coop.","• Split-screen multiplayer up to 4-players (only requires a single game copy).","Make your Hero:","• 7 Races: Human, Dwarf, Elf, Halfling, Orc, Goblin and Drog'al (lizard).","• 5 Classes: Champion, Ranger, Cleric, Wizard, and Rogue.","• Customize the appearance of your Hero.","Become a Legend:","• Collect a huge variety of Weapons, Armor, and Accessories to customize your Hero and grow in power."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202205/0322/X0q5V5xx5hnzdQEqVXVVYqpb.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202205/0322/X0q5V5xx5hnzdQEqVXVVYqpb.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202205/0322/xOhPche4iUuoToUnZV9CGWt6.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202205/0322/xOhPche4iUuoToUnZV9CGWt6.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202205/0322/6xsesGrPYPDMlZLIC9Ac9827.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202205/0322/6xsesGrPYPDMlZLIC9Ac9827.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"}],"summary":"Dungeons of Sundaria is an action-packed RPG where Heroes adventure through epic dungeons facing fearsome creatures either solo or with a group of friends."},"PPSA08541":{"about":["An intricate and evocative tale of fates woven by gods and mortals, steeped in Norse mythology, punctuated by groundbreaking combat, and brought to life by a soundtrack considered among gaming's greatest. Behold the origin of the VALKYRIE PROFILE franchise for yourself.","This is a port from the PSP™ (PlayStation®Portable) version.","NEW FEATURES","New features such as rewind function, quick save and load, visual presets, etc have been added.","KEY FEATURES","-Intertwining tales that spin a captivating story amid the epic backdrop of Norse Mythology","-Deep, action-packed combat, with exhilarating combos and satisfying special attacks","-Motoi Sakuraba's timeless soundtrack","-Multiple endings based on your actions and choices","MYTHOS","Long ago, the worlds were forged: Midgard, the domain of mortals, and Asgard, the realm of celestial beings—elves, giants, and gods.","Amid the heavens, the sands of time flowed peaceably, until one fateful day. What began as a simple feud between the Aesir and Vanir would soon ignite a divine war that would come to rage across the lands of men, heralding the coming of the end of the world."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0307/xF1jZyZ0hzGCdNaCDLn7vmQS.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0307/xF1jZyZ0hzGCdNaCDLn7vmQS.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0307/eyb9oRO4DXcRhFkVHROCXFz3.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0307/eyb9oRO4DXcRhFkVHROCXFz3.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0307/DeA36TyaGfSh2A0RzItm45Dt.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0307/DeA36TyaGfSh2A0RzItm45Dt.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"}],"summary":"An intricate and evocative tale of fates woven by gods and mortals, steeped in Norse mythology, punctuated by groundbreaking combat, and brought to life by a soundtrack considered among gaming's greatest."},"PPSA13709":{"about":["Figment 2: Creed Valley is an action-adventure game set in the human mind. Nightmares are spreading chaos and have overrun once-peaceful lands. Join Dusty, The Mind’s courage, as you make your way through puzzles, musical boss fights and unique environments. Face your fears head-on.","Nightmares have shattered the Moral Compass, making The Mind unable to function properly. Dusty and his ever-optimistic sidekick, Piper, must travel to Creed Valley, where The Mind’s ideals are formed to restore peace. A journey filled with musical showdowns and mind-bending puzzles awaits.","• Musical Showdowns","Nightmares have their own theme songs, shining light on why they have appeared. Dodge and weave as they taunt you.","• A Living, Rhythmic World","Chat with The Mind's ever-changing opinions and tune in to the world's rhythm.","• One Mind, Two Perspectives","Explore The Mind’s two fundamental states: Open-minded and Closed-minded. Switch between states and adapt to the shifting environment to move forward.","• Rack Your Brain, Hone Your Sword","Prove your mental and physical strength through mind-bending puzzles and fights timed to the soundtrack.","• Companion Mode","We should never have to face our fears alone. Piper is now a controllable character for local co-op."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/2112/eebd8a6945da02028ea94802e190cf43f1ee57d640d0b720.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/2112/eebd8a6945da02028ea94802e190cf43f1ee57d640d0b720.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/2112/18b28086f99c8854efc997825fb1de57e7b449b482436722.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/2112/18b28086f99c8854efc997825fb1de57e7b449b482436722.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/2112/14f561e97989bb227ba2cc6df28a1c5422c16c633649ceae.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202303/2112/14f561e97989bb227ba2cc6df28a1c5422c16c633649ceae.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"}],"summary":"Figment 2: Creed Valley is an action-adventure game set in the human mind. Nightmares are spreading chaos and have overrun once-peaceful lands."},"PPSA23172":{"about":["Keylocker is a Cyberpunk turn based rhythm JRPG inspired by the Mario&Luigi RPG series and Chrono Trigger, in which you play as the singer and songwriter, BOBO. Fuel your moves with the electric power of music in this unforgiving planet by using real-time execution of moves in rhythm game style! Battle the authorities, unlock the secrets of Saturn, play on your own bands' concerts and hack into the network to bring an end to this corrupt system, for better or worse."],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc8nvb.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sc8nvb.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc8nvd.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sc8nvd.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc8nvf.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sc8nvf.jpg"}],"summary":"Keylocker is a Cyberpunk turn based rhythm JRPG inspired by the Mario&Luigi RPG series and Chrono Trigger, in which you play as the singer and songwriter, BOBO."},"PPSA29952":{"about":["Flip, trick and grind your train in a fast-paced, off-the-rails ride through a colourful Japanese dystopia. Outmatch rival gangs, wreck a shady megacorp, and take back the tracks with nothing but skill, speed, and style."],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/scym2a.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/scym2a.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/scym2b.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/scym2b.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/scym2c.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/scym2c.jpg"}],"summary":"Flip, trick and grind your train in a fast-paced, off-the-rails ride through a colourful Japanese dystopia. Outmatch rival gangs, wreck a shady megacorp, and take back the tracks with nothing but skill, speed, and style."},"PPSA33152":{"about":["Set against the backdrop of a distorted Shibuya—where supernatural anomalies have begun bleeding into reality—the story follows two dual protagonists. Both harbor these very anomalies within themselves as they embark on a dark quest to uncover the truth behind the city's eerie phenomena."],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc142kd.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sc142kd.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc142ke.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sc142ke.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc142kf.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sc142kf.jpg"}],"summary":"Set against the backdrop of a distorted Shibuya—where supernatural anomalies have begun bleeding into reality—the story follows two dual protagonists."},"PPSA34884":{"about":["Ratatan is a rhythm roguelike action game that combines rhythm games and side-scrolling action, with online co-op gameplay supporting up to 4 players. An intense battle unfolds with over 100 characters fighting in a massive melee. Let's defeat the enemies together!"],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/scno5i.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/scno5i.jpg"}],"summary":"Ratatan is a rhythm roguelike action game that combines rhythm games and side-scrolling action, with online co-op gameplay supporting up to 4 players."},"PPSA35022":{"about":["Note: This product is also available as part of a bundle. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases.","YinYang Street: Separate Ways, as the spin-off of YinYang Street Ultimate Edition, completes the story through Duan Lifang’s eyes. Duan Lifang, a woman from Bai minority, is an ordinary employee at the Spring City Textile Mill. One day, her husband returns home on leave. After a long separation, the couple decides to go to the nearby cinema to watch a film called Flower on the Plateau. However, this dreamlike romantic date unexpectedly triggers a series of bizarre and inexplicable events...","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense).","You can download and play this content on the main PS5 console associated with your account (through the “Console Sharing and Offline Play” setting) and on any other PS5 consoles when you login with your same account."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/0d5415e86626fcc479f9e7d58a09bbdc8ef2f3cb3f13e280.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/0d5415e86626fcc479f9e7d58a09bbdc8ef2f3cb3f13e280.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/f99a0cd4455f747efb4d7bd0ee481fea5459646dc3c6b979.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/f99a0cd4455f747efb4d7bd0ee481fea5459646dc3c6b979.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/c3bd6c651b38fb51480071bea883dca3c97bb7fb31333f7b.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/c3bd6c651b38fb51480071bea883dca3c97bb7fb31333f7b.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"}],"summary":"Note: This product is also available as part of a bundle. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases."},"PPSA35023":{"about":["Note: This product is also available as part of a bundle. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases.","The story of this game takes place in a border town in the 1980s. Our protagonist Li Minglai is involved in an important operation. He runs into a series of strange things and finds his beloved wife missing when he comes home. Where used to be warm and sweet is now full of mysteries, which lead to a place called YinYang Street. Is this a coincidence or a conspiracy? Li Minglai has no time to think about it. All he could do is rush to YinYang Street and explore the bottomless abyss...","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense).","You can download and play this content on the main PS5 console associated with your account (through the “Console Sharing and Offline Play” setting) and on any other PS5 consoles when you login with your same account."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/bfe5037895415d60d049bf2f12d7dcebbe5b010c94bb4c48.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/bfe5037895415d60d049bf2f12d7dcebbe5b010c94bb4c48.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/bd3b6c8048aa678ea325ecca78b35814c30104052e0013e6.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/bd3b6c8048aa678ea325ecca78b35814c30104052e0013e6.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/78c4afc4cd4df1d06a8d04bf4165104df3ed57c747bbd53a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202606/0810/78c4afc4cd4df1d06a8d04bf4165104df3ed57c747bbd53a.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"}],"summary":"Note: This product is also available as part of a bundle. Please take care to avoid duplicate purchases."}},"scanned":{"added":["PPSA04259","PPSA08541","PPSA13709","PPSA23172","PPSA29952","PPSA33152","PPSA34884","PPSA35022","PPSA35023"],"updated":["CUSA32246"]}}